---
import '../styles/components/Services.css';
---
<section id="servicos" class="services-section">
    <div class="services-grid container">
        <!-- Dev Card -->
        <div class="glass-card service-card group">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper dev-icon group-hover-scale">
                <svg class="service-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">Sites de Elite</h3>
            <p class="service-text">
                Desenvolvemos Landing Pages com <strong>Astro</strong> e <strong>Vue.js</strong> que carregam em milissegundos. Velocidade é conversão.
            </p>
            <ul class="service-list list-dev">
                <li class="service-list-item">✓ 100/100 no Lighthouse</li>
                <li class="service-list-item">✓ Mobile-First Real</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Ads Card -->
        <div class="glass-card service-card group service-card-featured">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper ads-icon group-hover-scale">
                <svg class="service-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">Tráfego de Guerra</h3>
            <p class="service-text">
                Gestão implacável de anúncios no Google e Meta. Capturamos a demanda de quem já quer comprar de você.
            </p>
            <ul class="service-list list-ads">
                <li class="service-list-item">✓ Foco total em ROI</li>
                <li class="service-list-item">✓ Dashboards em Tempo Real</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- SEO Card -->
        <div class="glass-card service-card group">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper seo-icon group-hover-scale">
                <svg class="service-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">Domínio Local</h3>
            <p class="service-text">
                Seja a primeira opção no Google Maps. Se eles não te encontram, eles compram do seu vizinho.
            </p>
            <ul class="service-list list-seo">
                <li class="service-list-item">✓ Posicionamento no Topo</li>
                <li class="service-list-item">✓ Autoridade Regional</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
